# Back-colour erase: the erased region keeps the current colours but not the
# graphic rendition. `ESC[7m ESC[K` must clear to end of line, not paint an
# inverse bar, and the same applies to underline.
size: 8x2
description: erasing honours colours but not inverse or underline

--- input
\e[7m\e[4m\e[44mAB\e[K

--- expect-cell
row=0 col=4 inverse=false underline=false has_background=true
